# Many files in this repository are checked against recorded SHA-256 hashes
# (SHA256SUMS.json, MANIFEST_SHA256.json, PACKAGE_MANIFEST.json, ...).
# Turn off end-of-line conversion for every file, so that each platform checks
# out exactly the committed bytes. (Git for Windows would otherwise convert
# LF to CRLF on checkout and CRLF to LF on commit, which changes the hashes.)
* -text
